  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "The strongest in the Famicom world\r\n☆Play against the  and  who have their own special tactics. Moreover, his hands are surprisingly fast.\r\n☆Koji Tanigawa will judge your shogi skills using 40 practical ``Tsume Shogi'' questions and 20 ``Next Move'' questions.\r\n●Game (suitable for beginners to 2nd grade) ●Next move (suitable for 1st to 4th dan) ●Tsume Shogi (suitable for 5th grade to 2nd dan)"
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Le légendaire joueur de Shogi Kouji Tanigawa fait figure d'instructeur pour le joueur et l'apprend à jouer au Shogi et à gérer des situations difficiles."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Der legendäre Shogi-Spieler Kouji Tanigawa ist Ausbilder für den Spieler und lehrt ihn, Shogi zu spielen und schwierige Situationen zu bewältigen."
